Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:00:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类文明诞生以来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the beginning of civilization,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:00:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就已深谙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've known there's something captivating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,观看同胞为生存而战斗的乐趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about watching human beings fight for their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才有了角斗士竞技场 公开处决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we watch gladiator games, public executions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为那些依旧渴望兽性的人类创造了一种体育竞技\N{\fnArial\fs30}We created a sport for people who still have a thirst for savagery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.47,0:01:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的客户都是世界上最位高权重的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our customers are some of the most powerful people in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这游戏还真的挺有意思的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real fun game, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一年他们的欲望都在升级{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every year they demand more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,更复杂的密室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More complicated rooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多以生死为赌注的游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}more ways to gamble on life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们创造了一场终极生死大戏 请他们成为坐上贵宾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we provided them with a box seat for life's ultimate drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.65,0:01:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,“这是一张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This serves as an entry voucher…"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺斯密室逃脱的入场券”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…for Minos Escape Rooms."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么游戏规则吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there rules and regulations, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得在规定时间内逃出密室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to escape before the clock runs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有看起来像拼图或密码的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything that looks like a puzzle or a code.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,数字很重要 可以代表各种东西 各种地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numbers are very important. It could be anything, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 你先走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey, you go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在看 我们每一步行动都在他们眼皮底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're watching. They know every move we're making.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道我们所有事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew everything about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 该死的 佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey! Goddamn it. Zoey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.06,0:02:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为了我们牺牲了自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sacrificed herself for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是设计这个杀人迷宫的疯子吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the psycho that designed this murder maze, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.15,0:02:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是游戏管理员 密室是谜题创作者设计的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm the Games Master. The Puzzle Maker designs the rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:14.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（游戏中）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是回来救我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我不想再当唯一的幸存者了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, I'm tired of being the only survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我想象出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not imagining this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.87,0:02:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要忘了这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta let this shit go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.45,0:02:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有收到邀请函的人都死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else who was sent those invitations died,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而寄信的人却还好好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and whoever sent them is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个商标 这是曼哈顿中心的坐标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The logo. They're coordinates in the middle of Manhattan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.30,0:02:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.76,Title,0,0,0,0,,《密室逃生2：幸存者游戏》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗洗睡吧 很晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and wash up. It's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定累了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我能跟爸爸打个招呼吗 我想跟他讲讲今天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Can I say hi to Dad? I wanna tell him about our day…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你也知道他工作很忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You know he's busy working.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天很开心 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a lot of fun today, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我交稿期限要到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am on a deadline,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道如果超时会有什么后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know what happens if I miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not doing Claire any favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对克莱尔没有任何好处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by pretending nothing is wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经下定决心了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再这样下去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把她从我身边抢走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna take her away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想拆散这个家庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna break up this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个家已经散了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This family is already broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没有时间谈这个 我进度已经落后了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time for this. I am already behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一个小时后 我忙完了 我们再聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can talk about this in an hour when I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.94,0:04:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会改变心意的 - 就一个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not gonna change my mind. - One hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 给我个机会跟你好好谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Just give me the chance to talk this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以放松一下 游个泳 整理一下思绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take the time, have a swim, clear your head and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证不会跟你吵 好好听你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't argue, I promise. I'll just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想跟你玩这个游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not playing this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 亲爱的 没必要这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, honey, you don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我刚那样说 求你了 天呐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for what I said. Please. God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 该死的 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! Damn it, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.89,0:08:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,“我从泥土而生 风令我畏缩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I grow in earth. I shrink in wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,水会淹没我 火却奈何不了我 我是什么”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drown in water. I survive in fire. What am I?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.81,0:09:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好思考 思考“从泥土而生”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, think. Think! "Grow in earth."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:08.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（注意 98 摄氏度）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.78,0:09:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,“风令我畏缩 火却奈何不了我”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Shrink in wind. Survive in fire."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是石头 石头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a rock. Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这是什么 这是什么 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What is it? What is it? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.45,0:09:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个颜色不一样 肯定是它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a different color. It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:35.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（注意 104 摄氏度）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是干什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是块磁铁 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a magnet. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 快下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:52.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警告 110 摄氏度）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.70,0:09:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,金属{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:57.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警告 120 摄氏度）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.89,0:10:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:23.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（132 摄氏度）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:47.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（138 摄氏度 致命错误　极端高温）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束模拟游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ending sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想重置游戏吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna reset?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 干得不错 我们准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Good work. We're ready for game time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 存活率是多少 - 大约百分之四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the probability of survival? - It's approximately 4%.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴佐伊克服了对飞行的恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad Zoey got over her fear of flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不算太晚的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too late. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么太晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get out of here, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:12:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想 我们可以离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could walk away if we wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.53,0:12:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经在登机口了 本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're literally at the gate, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.57,0:12:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以去吃块披萨 看看比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could just go grab a slice. You know, catch a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Catch a game"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 我只是想说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I'm just saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以不用这么做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你反悔了 - 不 不 我支持你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're having second thoughts? - No, no, I'm sticking by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能活着离开那些游戏已经很幸运了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we were lucky to get out of those games alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得继续我们的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think that it's okay, that we can…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是可以理解的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺斯还在杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minos is still killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以不用来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞蛾扑火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flying heroically into danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是自费去飞蛾扑火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or flying, you know, discount economy into danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩斯勒 她今天怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ensler. How is she today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去很专注{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like always, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等 我快搞完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One second, I'm almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做得不错 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did a good job. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 克莱尔 你一向很出色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know, Claire, you do wonderful work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你明白这一次风险有多高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to understand how high the stakes are this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管如何 我还是被关在笼子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, I'll still be locked in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我有什么意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think you'd last down here…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能在这撑多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if anything happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.44,0:13:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你应该自己打造这些密室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should've built these rooms yourself, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是沉迷于如何杀死佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of obsessing over a way to kill Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还没有准备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她觉得她可以曝光我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks that she can expose us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,异想天开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chrissake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我比你多了解她一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I just understand her a little bit better than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.37,0:14:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道失去妈妈是什么感受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we both know what it's like to lose our mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 好了 谢谢 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. There we go. Thank you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位乘客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next passenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:43.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（违禁物品）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.07,0:14:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示你的机票 女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ticket, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:14:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你飞行愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你期待去越南吗 - 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you excited for Vietnam? - Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我做不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做不到 - 没事的 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't do this. - Yeah, okay. So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Hey, Zoey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Hey, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我们只能租最烂的车 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said we could only afford the shittiest car they had, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.43,0:15:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设法弄到了一个四门的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to boost us up to a four-door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.85,0:15:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,雨刷坏掉的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a broken windshield wiper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们签了租车单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we sign the release.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:15:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么还会愿意跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you still willing to come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想阻止米诺斯什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I wanna stop Minos and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我连飞机都上不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't even get on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来不想告诉你 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't wanna tell you this, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被解雇了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got fired from my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在客户面前恐慌发作了 我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a panic attack in front of a client, we were…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.55,0:16:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,走出一扇门 它卡住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}walking out of a door, it got stuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就崩溃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I broke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不是一个人有这种感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're not alone in feeling this way. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我对救过我命的人总是有种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, I tend to have this weird loyalty thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇妙的忠诚感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for people who save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太感激我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank me too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车的人是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one that's gotta drive the whole way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定不想在克利夫兰停一下吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you don't wanna stop in Cleveland?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 我说了不要绕路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, I said no detours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这要求很过分 谢谢你陪我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this is a lot to ask, so thank you for coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太感激我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't thank me too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有加油钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any gas money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我一点钱都没了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不想在接下来的两天里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm not spending the next two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.23,0:17:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你坐在一辆满是烟味的车里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a car full of smoke with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:33.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（路边旅店）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能睡觉了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we go to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你累了吗 - 没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you tired? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.45,0:17:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should try, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.25,0:17:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去吧 - 不 你去 你先站起来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go ahead. - No, you go. You go. You stood up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不不 - 你去吧不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no. - You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去 去吧 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, go. Go ahead. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 哥们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smooth move, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 本 门锁上了 我出不去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben? Ben, it's locked! I can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佐伊 - 本 本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zoey? - Ben! Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.55,0:18:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佐伊 - 我出不去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zoey! - I can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,操{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.44,0:18:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.53,0:18:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:18:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,操 我操{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 发生什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. What's wrong? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么了 - 我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,操{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你刚做了个噩梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I think you just had a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.81,0:19:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见 我看见那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw…I saw the…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个房顶就{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole thing was just…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我只是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It was just…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得曝光他们 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta get these guys. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们离开这里吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:36.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约市）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一栋废弃的政府大楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an abandoned government building.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有记录 没有地契{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no record, there's no deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全是个黑洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a total black hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里 我们到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来米诺斯已经破产了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Minos went out of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定坐标没错吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we sure we got the coordinates right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说不通啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 这是两天前的视频 里面都是工人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. This was from two days ago. It's filled with workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to be the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能先绕一圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just circle the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,再进入这个地狱陷阱般的噩梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we enter this hell-trap nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以待在外面 - 抱歉 我不是这个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can stay out here. - Sorry, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,先停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.91,0:20:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不要 佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no. Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能再查一下这个坐标吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just look at the coordinates again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们看错了数字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we got a number wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的不该进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really shouldn't be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要答案 本 我们都大老远来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need answers. Ben We came this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.07,0:20:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,得找到答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.31,0:20:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都锁上了 没用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all locked. There's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 里面什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - There's nothing in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们从头开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Let's just retrace the steps. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里肯定有什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be something in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:20:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不该来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不安全 这地方被查封了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe. This place is condemned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你们进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can help you get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我好几天没吃东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't eaten in a couple of days though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们能帮帮我吗 - 听着 我不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you maybe help me out? - Look, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况 停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What the hell? Come on, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来 你给我回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back! Come on, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.27,0:21:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.27,0:21:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.49,0:21:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人拦住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本 - 佐伊 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ben! - Zoey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:21:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来 哥们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Get back here, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他 抓住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Get him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.51,0:22:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,操{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.77,0:22:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们去下一站找警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, we'll find a cop at the next station.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有监控录像什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's some surveillance footage or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.98,0:22:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要 找不回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's no point. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我妈妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my mom's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.74,0:22:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.83,0:22:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该在下一站下车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we should get off at the next stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后回大楼那去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go back to the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里面有什么东西 我知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. There's something there, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们自己想办法进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We're gonna find our own way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 新规矩 不再跟吸毒的家伙说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, new rule, no more talking to junkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.85,0:22:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你不会相信我现在在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby. You're not gonna believe where I am right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.81,0:22:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我在地铁上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I am on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.35,0:22:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今早根本发动不了那个破车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't get the damn thing to start this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不把车停在健身房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to leave the car at the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.19,0:23:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道 我明天会处理的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I'll take care of it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 听着 我会遵守对孩子许下的承诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because! Listen, when I make my baby a promise, I keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.83,0:23:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.45,0:23:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那一次 你妈妈不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that was one time. Your mother doesn't like…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.46,0:23:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,地铁噪音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Train noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.34,0:23:31.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（沙漏湾 在沙滩里放飞自己）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.23,0:23:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.27,0:23:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,列车长不是应该在这里吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't the conductor supposed to be in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.02,0:23:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:23:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.75,0:24:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不太妙 糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bad, right? Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.63,0:24:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 我一会儿打给你 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby, I'll call you back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.25,0:24:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.46,0:24:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 车厢刚刚分离了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. The train just uncoupled!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.47,0:24:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么叫分离了 - 它们分开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean, uncoupled? - They separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.93,0:24:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.68,0:24:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.10,0:24:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下按钮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the button!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.31,0:24:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我按了按钮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have hit the button!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.44,0:24:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hold on to something!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.66,0:24:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱碰那东西 做点什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop touching shit! Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.66,0:24:39.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（紧急制动）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.04,0:24:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,操 你在跟我开玩笑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Oh, you've gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.17,0:24:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小蒂 你听到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiff, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.80,0:24:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,操{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.34,0:24:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是铁轨末端吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the end of the track?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.09,0:24:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.22,0:25:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 走走走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Run! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.49,0:25:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.54,0:25:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 还好 你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.29,0:25:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 你没流血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you're not bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.54,0:25:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.96,0:25:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My head.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.85,0:25:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 起来吧 你可以的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come on. Get up, you got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.23,0:25:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.69,0:25:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.36,0:25:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你有东西漏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, you're leaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.61,0:25:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得现在喝酒太早了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think it's early for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.99,0:25:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天真是越来越精彩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This day just gets better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.16,0:25:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得要多久 才会有人来找我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you think till someone comes for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.49,0:26:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.49,0:26:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,底下的废弃铁轨有一百英里长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like 100 miles of derelict track down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.00,0:26:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且没人知道我们在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one knows where the hell we are,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.46,0:26:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要我猜 要很久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'd say long as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.96,0:26:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.21,0:26:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手机没信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.71,0:26:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等救援队到了再叫我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know when the cavalry arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.88,0:26:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.51,0:26:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来我们在一个废弃站点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're in an abandoned station.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.39,0:26:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're shitting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.94,0:26:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.36,0:26:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有六个人被困在这里了 有人帮忙吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you got six people trapped in here. Somebody sending help?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.53,0:26:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘客请注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, passengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.40,0:26:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,请时刻注意好自己的行李物品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your belongings in sight at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.66,0:26:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们看见了可疑的包裹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see a suspicious package,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.57,0:26:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告知最近的纽约大都会运输署员工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}please tell the nearest MTA employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.41,0:26:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持警惕 祝你们好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remain alert and good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.96,0:26:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺斯找到我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minos found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.92,0:26:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚说“米诺斯”了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just say "Minos"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.05,0:26:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,又开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.34,0:26:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.47,0:27:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.60,0:27:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我就知道我不应该回来 我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I knew I shouldn't have come back. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.81,0:27:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你们以前都参加过这个游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What, you guys have played the game before?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.40,0:27:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你以为我为什么戴助听器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think I got this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.86,0:27:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们他妈的把我关在一艘潜水艇里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They locked me in a goddamn submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.15,0:27:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后增加气压 直到我的耳膜爆开为止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they increased the air pressure until my eardrums burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.78,0:27:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that makes this what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.41,0:27:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,冠军锦标赛吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tournament of champions?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.03,0:27:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.29,0:27:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.25,0:27:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.67,0:27:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再玩这个游戏了 你们这群人渣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not playing this game again, you no-good pieces of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.76,0:27:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样做只会让情况更糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! You're making it worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.55,0:27:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把情况变得更糟糕 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make it worse, okay? Don't make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.47,0:27:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们能控制一辆地铁 他们也能加固车门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they can hijack a train, they can reinforce the doors, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.22,0:27:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是我老婆的生日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my wife's birthday today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.81,0:27:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉她我不会迟到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her I wouldn't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.69,0:27:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是迟到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always late.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.61,0:28:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该更努力的 我应该说服你不要来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've done more. I should've convinced you not to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.20,0:28:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 本 看着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, Ben, Ben. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们曾经出去过 我们会再次做到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we broke out once. We'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.93,0:28:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.79,0:28:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好不要抱有这个幻想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get that fantasy out of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.29,0:28:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前都经历过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we've all been through this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.67,0:28:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们解决了谜题 我们赢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We solve the puzzles, we win.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.13,0:28:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得到了自由 - 你是指 只有一人能赢吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We go free. - You mean, one of us does.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.18,0:28:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.74,0:28:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到底是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.35,0:29:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不喜欢这个声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.25,0:29:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 我刚刚被电了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Shit, I just got shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.46,0:29:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.13,0:29:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把整节车厢都通电了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They electrified the entire car?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.05,0:29:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道规则 要么玩游戏 要么死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know how this works. We play the game or we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.13,0:29:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他们想让我们做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is exactly what they want us to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.84,0:29:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是像猴子一样供他们娱乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, dance for their amusement.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.30,0:29:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们是怎么想的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.55,0:29:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不要死在没人过问的Q号线里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not dying on nobody's Q Train.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.06,0:29:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘客请注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, passengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.98,0:29:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请时刻注意好自己的行李物品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your belongings in sight at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.23,0:30:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们看见了可疑的包裹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see a suspicious package,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.19,0:30:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告知最近的纽约大都会运输署员工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}please tell the nearest MTA employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.09,0:30:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持警惕 祝你们好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remain alert and good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.55,0:30:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了一个包 是你们的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I found a bag. This belong to any of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.30,0:30:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.22,0:30:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一条毛巾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a towel…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.18,0:30:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 靠 - 小心点 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - Hey, careful, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.94,0:30:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 让我们找出来这个把手应该安装在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's find out what that handle goes to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.44,0:30:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人分头行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.03,0:30:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都小心别碰到柱子 - 还用你说 哥们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Careful about the poles. - Seriously, homeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.91,0:30:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手肯定是放在一扇门上的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be to one of the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.45,0:30:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手是金属的 所以我们得小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The handle's metal so we need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.30,0:30:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我应该找到出口了 - 太好了 有用到把手吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I found the way out. - Oh, great. Does it need the handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.97,0:30:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 这是扇活板门 肯定有其他办法打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's a trapdoor. There's gotta be another way to open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.26,0:30:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 - 拜托 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus Christ. - Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.89,0:30:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没听完整线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aren't listening to the whole clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.85,0:31:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说向运输署的员工报告 对吧 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said report any of this shit to the MTA employee, right? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.23,0:31:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是是司机车厢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the conductor booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.94,0:31:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快把那玩意给我 - 你小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just give me the damn thing. - Will you be careful?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.11,0:31:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 我们没得选了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We don't have a choice, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.61,0:31:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.45,0:31:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们享受刚刚那一幕 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you enjoyed that, assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.33,0:31:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.62,0:31:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 皮革是绝缘体 - 对 聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leather's an insulator. - Yeah, yeah, that's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.47,0:31:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.94,0:31:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.90,0:31:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.73,0:31:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩下去反而让情况更糟糕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing makes it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.23,0:31:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是旧式的地铁投币口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… It's one of those old subway token slots.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.65,0:31:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只在小时候看见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen one since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.40,0:31:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 所以我们需要硬币 有人看见过硬币吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so we need tokens. Anyone see any tokens anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.99,0:31:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个牌子上说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. What does that sign say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.74,0:31:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,“所有错误广告牌需要撤下”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"All false advertising must be pulled."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.41,0:32:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许硬币在广告后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the tokens are behind the ads?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.75,0:32:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是广告框都是金属的 所以我们需要工具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the frames are metal, so we need a tool to pull them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.04,0:32:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 等会“所有错误广告”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, wait."All false advertising."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.50,0:32:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前注意到了一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I noticed something earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.21,0:32:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这 这个广告牌是讲沙漏湾的 上面说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here. This ad for Hourglass Bay, it says:
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.05,0:32:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,“在沙滩里放飞自己”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lose yourself in the sand."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.58,0:32:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己的拼写少了个E{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Yourself" is missing an E.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.93,0:32:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查所有的广告牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check all the signage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.26,0:32:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看是不是还有拼写错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if there are any more misspellings. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.60,0:32:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.39,0:32:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 C{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here! C.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.69,0:32:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,“统计数据”里少了个C{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a C missing in "statistic."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.81,0:32:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 C E 他们是要拼个字母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, C, E… They're trying to spell something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.57,0:32:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 线索里说了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. What did the clue say?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.20,0:32:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,“所有错误广告牌需要撤下”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"All false advertising must be pulled."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.11,0:32:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺失的字母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The missing letters…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.41,0:32:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人注意到这里有多少拉手吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has everybody noticed how many handles there are?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.37,0:32:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁会数 - 二十六{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who counts how many… - Twenty-six.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.96,0:32:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟字母表里的字母数字一样 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like letters in the alphabet. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.71,0:32:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把和缺失字母对应的拉手扯下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pull the corresponding handles of the missing letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.96,0:32:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯金属拉手 我希望大家都没有心脏问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull he metal handles? I hope no one has a heart condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.76,0:32:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果用毛巾呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we use the towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.76,0:32:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 棉不是很好的绝缘体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, cotton is not a good enough insulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.09,0:32:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,包里还有其他东西吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else in the bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.26,0:32:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 包的内衬是橡胶 我们可以用这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, the lining is rubber. We could use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.93,0:33:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人带钥匙了吗 我把橡胶裁开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anybody have keys, so I can cut it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.14,0:33:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有有有 给{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.07,0:33:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人能把钥匙递给我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anybody wanna hand me keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.11,0:33:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.57,0:33:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,传过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.37,0:33:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 有橡胶了 该拉哪一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. We're rubbered up. Which one are we pulling?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.99,0:33:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有个绿拉手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there's a green handle here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.08,0:33:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意到另一边有个红的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed a red one at the other end.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.71,0:33:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色的是A 红色的是Z 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green is A, red is Z, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.63,0:33:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们从这里开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is where we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.04,0:33:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 C是字母表里的第三个 所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. C is the third letter of the alphabet, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.01,0:33:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人反对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.76,0:33:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 拉吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.18,0:33:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 你可以的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.94,0:33:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个C 第一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A C, that's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.77,0:33:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 字母 两个C 那一定有含义的 对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look! Letters. Two Cs. That's gotta mean something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.57,0:33:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况更糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.62,0:34:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 继续找 - 快快快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, keep moving! - Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.49,0:34:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快放 - 没有电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - No shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.91,0:34:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是接地了 我们还需要八个硬币{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be grounded. We need eight more tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.71,0:34:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好“释放自己”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay."Lose yourself."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.21,0:34:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,A B C D E！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A, B, C, D, E.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.92,0:34:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 所有人分散开找字母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - Everybody split up, look for letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.93,0:34:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好好好 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah, yeah. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.43,0:34:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我们要没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, we're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.72,0:34:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要七个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.81,0:34:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看车厢后面 那边一定有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the back of the train. Gotta be something there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.35,0:34:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一半到底是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does half this shit even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.73,0:34:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里多了一个M - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's an extra M here! - Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.19,0:34:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有一个A 缺了个A - 我去拿A{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And an A! An A missing. - I'll get the A!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.15,0:34:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- M M - 准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- M! M! - Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.32,0:34:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.78,0:34:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还需要五枚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need five more!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.99,0:34:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.00,0:34:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.50,0:34:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去拿硬币 - 她没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get the token. - She okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.67,0:34:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没事 快去 - 代币在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's fine. Keep going. - Where's the token?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.38,0:34:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里缺了一个K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is missing a K!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.84,0:34:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,“提前叫车” 这里还多了一个L{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Call a cab in advance." There's an extra L here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.96,0:34:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 快去L那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Back to L!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.72,0:35:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找到L了吗 - 是的 找到L了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got the L? - Okay! I got L!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.93,0:35:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还缺五个 - 该死 这是猜词画人游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five more. - Oh, shit. It's a game of Hangman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.43,0:35:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下一定很痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.81,0:35:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么又是这样 - 快把硬币给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This can't be happening. - Hey! Give me the token!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.11,0:35:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把硬币给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the token!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.11,0:35:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, man, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.86,0:35:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都趴下别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.74,0:35:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 西奥 快起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, Theo, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.12,0:35:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佐伊 你要干什么 - 这是我们想要的证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zoey, what are you doing? - It's the proof we came here for!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.71,0:35:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快趴下 - 快投币{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down! - Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.67,0:35:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还缺什么字母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the other letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.22,0:35:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还缺三个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's three!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.68,0:35:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.90,0:35:53.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约市地铁线路图）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.82,0:36:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我找到缺失的字母了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Guys, I found the missing letter…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.72,0:36:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.26,0:36:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.89,0:36:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他找到的字母是什么 - 不知道 地图烧毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do we know what letters he found? - No, the map is burnt out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.90,0:36:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 你有办法吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey! Got any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.61,0:36:41.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎回来）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.57,0:36:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺失的字母是W B和O{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The missing letters are W, B, and O!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.99,0:36:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的 - 我就是知道 快去拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know? - I just know. Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.59,0:37:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,B、O！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}B, O!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.72,0:37:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.28,0:37:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还缺一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.99,0:37:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.70,0:37:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安息吧 兄弟 - 该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sleep well, brother. - Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.70,0:37:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我 把硬币给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand it to me! Give me the token!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.63,0:37:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,门开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door is open!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.05,0:37:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 快走 快走 离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Go! Go, go! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.76,0:37:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.60,0:37:55.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎回来）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.98,0:37:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 快点 跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey, hurry! Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.69,0:38:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.36,0:38:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.79,0:38:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.04,0:38:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在下降{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.22,0:38:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 刚死了一个人 我们可以缓一缓吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait. Somebody just died. Can we just have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.93,0:38:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们应该默哀一会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should have a minute of silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.18,0:38:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我们刚刚失去了一个同伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we did just lose somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.69,0:38:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意默哀就默哀吧 他们一定看得很开心呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be as silent as you want. They're eating this shit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.23,0:38:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人知道他叫什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody even know his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.53,0:38:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.62,0:38:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫布莉安娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Brianna.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.58,0:38:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Nate.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.91,0:38:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫瑞秋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.12,0:38:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.71,0:38:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.38,0:39:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,地铁对大家有什么特殊意义吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did the train mean anything to anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.38,0:39:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟透了 我们刚刚差点死在里面 这算吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was horrible. We almost died. Does that count?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.80,0:39:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我的意思是这都是谜题的一部分 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I mean, this is all part of a puzzle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.60,0:39:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那组所有人都是唯一幸存者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for our groups, we were all lone survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.76,0:39:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果密室都是根据我们的意外定制的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if the rooms were tailored around our accidents…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.89,0:39:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许刚刚那个密室是为死掉的仁兄设计的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the last room was designed for the guy who died in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你们的组呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, what about your groups?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.15,0:39:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得这其中是否有些联系呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think there was any connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.82,0:39:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那组都是网红{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My group was all influencers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.90,0:39:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 所以你的特殊技能就是自拍吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, so your special skills were selfies?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.86,0:39:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的特殊技能是旅游日志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my special skill was travel blogging.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.20,0:39:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在阿塔卡玛露营 去泰国的大象避难所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camping in Atacama, elephant sanctuaries in Thailand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.58,0:39:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似这种东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.00,0:39:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一百万的粉丝 赚了些钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a million followers, made some money,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.71,0:39:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就有了这道疤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then this scar happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.96,0:39:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的密室是一个爆炸的镜厅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My last room was an exploding hall of mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.34,0:39:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这组真奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a weird category, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.84,0:39:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的教区给我寄了一封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a letter from my diocese.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.09,0:39:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你是一个神父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so you're a priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.47,0:40:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,信上让我去一个教堂之间的研讨会之类的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It called me to some interchurch seminar or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.02,0:40:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等我到了那 - 我猜猜 还有五个神父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When I get there… - Let me guess. Five more priests?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.73,0:40:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来就像个烂俗的笑话吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beginning of a bad joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.94,0:40:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那组 他们是想要看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, in ours they wanted to see if.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.03,0:40:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,信仰能否让我们活下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if faith helped us survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.20,0:40:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.79,0:40:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在游荡 感到非常迷茫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep walking around up there, so lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.51,0:40:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.05,0:40:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真的不明白 - 明白什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just don't understand. - Understand what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.97,0:40:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么上帝让我活了下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why God spared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.60,0:40:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事听得差不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's enough story time…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.01,0:40:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.77,0:40:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我赢得游戏的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I won the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.14,0:40:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个大概是欧洲人的混蛋想勒死我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}some vaguely European asshole tried to strangle me to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.36,0:40:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之所以能活下来都是多亏了佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only reason I got out was because of Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.19,0:40:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以怎么回事 他们就直接让你们走了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, they just let you all go free?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.11,0:40:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给了我一个拥抱 替我叫了一辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave me a hug, called me an Uber.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.95,0:40:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是一次非常愉快的体验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a really pleasant experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.24,0:40:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是想试着找出规律 就这样 仅此而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just trying to find a pattern. That's it. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.79,0:41:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他们在赌什么 那他们的思路是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they're betting on something. What's the angle here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.75,0:41:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能预判米诺斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't outthink Minos.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.62,0:41:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种不自量力会让我们所有人都陷入危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to is just going to put us all at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.54,0:41:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是这里唯一一个既救了自己还救了别人的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the only one here who saved somebody except for herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.55,0:41:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们为什么不听她的呢 - 因为我在地铁上听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so why not listen to her? - Because I heard you on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.05,0:41:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来正是因为听了她的话 你才又被卷进来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like listening to her is what got you back into this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.56,0:41:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该继续了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.03,0:41:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个装饰派艺术风格的死亡银行 好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An art deco bank of death. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.08,0:41:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在地下建了一个银行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They built a bank underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.25,0:41:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太疯狂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.71,0:41:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 保险库的门开着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the vault door's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.96,0:41:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能会这么容易 - 是啊 绝对不简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no way it's that easy. - Yeah, definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.09,0:41:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这明显是诱饵 - 是啊 还用说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clearly, they're baiting us. - Yeah, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.43,0:42:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.73,0:42:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.61,0:42:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,安保系统已激活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security system activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.23,0:42:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都别碰任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.28,0:42:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是地砖 你必须双脚踩到其它地方去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the tile. You need to step both feet off of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.50,0:42:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 踩到它会激活激光 - 救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's triggering the lasers. - Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.58,0:42:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来引导你 - 我不能动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna guide you. - I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.29,0:42:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓着我的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.04,0:42:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.54,0:42:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下来 慢慢往下蹲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your body. Nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.96,0:42:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.97,0:42:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 稳住 小心 - 等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Steady. Careful. - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.43,0:42:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在抬起你的左脚往我这边迈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna lift your left foot and bring it over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.47,0:42:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.31,0:42:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来 不急 这就对了 来我这 慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're ready. There you go. Over to me. Nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.81,0:42:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,压低身体 非常好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really low. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.81,0:42:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我接住你了 - 再低一点 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got you. - A little bit lower. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.11,0:42:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数到三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the count of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.94,0:42:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.36,0:42:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二 - 二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two. - Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.86,0:42:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一 - 一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One. - One.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.53,0:42:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.70,0:43:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没事吧 - 不不 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she okay? - No, no, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.74,0:43:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 不碰伤口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.12,0:43:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来皮肤好像和衣服熔到一起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It looks like the skin is fused to the shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.12,0:43:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分钟后激活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full laser-grid activation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.96,0:43:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全激光网格 - 该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in ten minutes. - Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.96,0:43:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.34,0:43:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有其他方法可以通过这些地砖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be another way across those tiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.88,0:43:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能一个一个测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't exactly test them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.38,0:43:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许可以绕道 - 好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe we can go around? - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.72,0:43:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许得费九牛二虎之力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well be a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.55,0:43:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我好像找到了一把钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys? I think I found a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.81,0:43:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 棒棒糖里是把钥匙吧 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Inside the lollipop. It's a key, right? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.11,0:43:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有很多保险箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, those are safety-deposit boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.65,0:43:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是开其中一个的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be for one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.07,0:43:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们还不知道去那边的路安不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, we don't know if it's safe over there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.07,0:43:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是给我们的提示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where the clue leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.54,0:43:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的地砖和中间的不一样 所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These tiles are different than the ones in the middle, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.96,0:43:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.92,0:43:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不多了 我们别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock's ticking. We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.84,0:44:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.55,0:44:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 继续找钥匙吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Look for some more keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.43,0:44:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一边的保险箱更多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more boxes on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.56,0:44:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能不能找到更多钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we can find any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.65,0:44:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,“你所在的位置”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You are here"?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.27,0:44:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.07,0:44:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险箱太多了 一定还有线索我们没找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many boxes. We're missing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.57,0:44:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,“待归档”在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To be filed." Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.49,0:44:26.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（索尼娅）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.33,0:44:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到一把钥匙了 - 好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Found a key. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.67,0:44:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又找到了一把钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found another key!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.75,0:44:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 试试另一边的柜子 - 我们去那边找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Try the boxes on the other side. - We'll check over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.55,0:44:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莉安娜 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brianna. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.39,0:44:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这得费点时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is gonna take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.77,0:44:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,八分钟后启动全激光网格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full laser-grid activation in eight minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.48,0:44:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨这帮狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate these sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.52,0:44:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.32,0:45:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到光明银行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Illuminus Bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.74,0:45:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲人去世后得到赔偿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For payment following the death of a loved one,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.49,0:45:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,请输入您的密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}please enter your PIN.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.45,0:45:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.95,0:45:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要密码 是什么 四个数字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a PIN code. What's that? Four numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.83,0:45:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个数字吗 好 我们要找四个数字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four numbers? Yeah, okay. We're looking for four numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.96,0:45:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有没有 该死的 都是三位数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see, is there one… Shit. All these are three.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.17,0:45:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入密码 遵循指示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Enter your PIN. Follow instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.71,0:45:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了拿收据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget to take your receipt."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.05,0:45:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,赔偿 公文包 在亲人去世后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Payment." Briefcases? "Following the death of a loved one."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.34,0:45:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,七分钟后启动全激光网格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full laser-grid activation in seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.01,0:45:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来我这儿 看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come here. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.85,0:45:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有柜子都有数字 就这个没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the boxes have numbers except for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.35,0:45:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尼娅 谁是索尼娅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sonya." Who's Sonya?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.90,0:45:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.56,0:45:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我 只有一个办法能知道答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.07,0:45:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.66,0:45:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞秋 你看这里有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel, look, there's something in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.45,0:45:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 这东西太锋利了 我流血了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Shit, that's really sharp. I'm bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.16,0:45:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到一个柜子 上面有个名字 索尼娅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a box with the name "Sonya" on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.21,0:45:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些锋利的钻石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some razor-sharp diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.63,0:46:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有谁找到什么 - 我们也找到了类似的柜子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anybody got anything else? - We got a box like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.00,0:46:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写着索尼娅 还有两叠空白钞票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says "Sonya" on it. And there's two stacks of blank bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.26,0:46:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道是什么意思 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know what it means. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.39,0:46:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,六分钟后启动全激光网格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full laser-grid activation in six minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.47,0:46:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,锋利钻石 空白钞票 还有叫索尼娅的妞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharp diamonds, blank bills, and a chick named Sonya.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.14,0:46:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们漏了点什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're missing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.77,0:46:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲人去世后得到赔偿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Following the payment of a death of a loved one."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.19,0:46:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们管亲人去世的赔偿金叫什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What do you call it when you get paid for a death?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.44,0:46:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抚恤金 - 快把钞票拿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blood money. - Hurry, bring the bills over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.95,0:46:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我们把血涂在钞票上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us to put blood on the bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.45,0:46:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错没错 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, yes. Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.17,0:46:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 瑞秋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no! - Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.33,0:46:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞秋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.96,0:46:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞秋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.13,0:46:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.92,0:46:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柜台是禁区 - 知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Counters are off-limits. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.84,0:46:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 牧师 去拿钞票 - 钞票没坏吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Priest guy, get the bills. - The bills okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.85,0:46:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 这叠是好的 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, this one's good. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.72,0:46:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把它们拿过来 小心 - 我希望这叠就够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bring them here. Careful. - I hope that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.93,0:46:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.23,0:47:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, what is that? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.02,0:47:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.53,0:47:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,〇五二六 试试 在柜员机上输入〇五二六{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, 0-5-2-6. Try that. Try 0-5-2-6 in the ATM.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.61,0:47:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,〇五二六{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}0-5-2-6.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.24,0:47:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看时钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.16,0:47:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家看到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.95,0:47:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,停在了纽约时间十二点过九分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stopped moving at 12:09 in New York,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.33,0:47:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦时间三点过两分 上海时间十二点过两分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}3:02 in London, and 12:03 in Shanghai.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.67,0:47:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么穿过地板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that get us across the floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.25,0:47:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们又有一条线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. We got another clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.42,0:47:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.38,0:47:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,按一天中的小时画出路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Plot a course by the hours of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.42,0:47:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,按分钟数脚步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count the minutes every step of the way."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.97,0:47:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许这是象棋里的坐标 行和列{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maybe it's coordinates like in chess. Row and column?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.39,0:47:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等下 我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.93,0:47:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,按小时画出路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Plot a course by the hours."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.85,0:47:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二点是直线 三点是向右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve o'clock is straight. Three o'clock is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.31,0:47:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.98,0:47:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以“按分钟数脚步”肯定是指距离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So "Count the steps every minute" must be the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.40,0:47:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思就是十二点过九分是直走九步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that means that 12:09 is straight, nine steps?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.49,0:47:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟后启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full laser-grid activation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.36,0:47:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全激光网格 - 我们怎么知道哪里是起点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in five minutes. - How do we know where to start from?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.41,0:47:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写着左起第三格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This says you start three tiles from the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.66,0:48:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 左起第三格 - 至少我是这么认为的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three tiles from the left! - At least, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.91,0:48:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 很多都是猜测的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. We're making a lot of assumptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.38,0:48:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总得试试 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta try something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.46,0:48:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我有个主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.96,0:48:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要 你要去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you… Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.09,0:48:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给你们设计一条路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna plot a course for the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.14,0:48:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.48,0:48:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 有效果 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It worked. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.65,0:48:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.82,0:48:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.45,0:48:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.41,0:48:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 你做得很棒 内特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You're doing great, Nate.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.71,0:48:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 九呢 九 好的 - 那是九 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nine? Nine. Okay. - That's nine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.04,0:48:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦时间是三点过两分 试试向你右边移动两步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's 3:02 in London, so try two steps to your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.26,0:49:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 第三个钟 上海 十二点过三分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, third clock, Shanghai, 12:03.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.02,0:49:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前走三步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's three steps forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.56,0:49:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.77,0:49:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.94,0:49:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.24,0:49:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 那儿有东西开了 看 就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Something opened over there. Look, right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.20,0:49:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一把密码锁 我们还需要三个号码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a combination lock. We need three more numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.41,0:49:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个数字 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three numbers. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.08,0:49:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, something's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.13,0:49:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有钱能使鬼推磨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Money makes the world turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.88,0:49:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要停止 否则一切都会结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let it stop or else it all ends."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.71,0:49:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.01,0:49:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要死 什么数字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. What number?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.09,0:49:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这里的编号吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The codes in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.89,0:49:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.10,0:49:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有国际账户{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's international accounts on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.02,0:49:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京和南非 或许是这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tokyo and South Africa. Maybe that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.23,0:49:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,每张纸上面都他妈有数字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every piece of paper in here has goddamn numbers on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.48,0:49:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三分钟后启动 - 完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Full laser-grid activation… - Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.27,0:49:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,全激光网格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.69,0:49:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找不到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.15,0:49:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家伙 我们来不及了 还有什么 快找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we're not gonna make it in time! What else is there? Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.91,0:50:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要慌 我们只需要继续找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't panic. We just need to keep looking, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.87,0:50:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.04,0:50:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.21,0:50:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.04,0:50:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要干什么 不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he doing? No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.13,0:50:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 内特 你在干什么 - 停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nate! What are you doing? - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.09,0:50:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等 我操 内特 不不不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Wait. Wait. Oh, shit! Nate! No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.84,0:50:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 搞什么 停下 内特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! What the hell? Stop it! Nate!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.22,0:50:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在那儿 待着别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay there. Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.27,0:50:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不确定那几格是否安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know if those tiles are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.81,0:50:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们什么线索都还没找到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we haven't found any clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.14,0:50:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你先停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just stop what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.06,0:50:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特 不要 站住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate! No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.86,0:50:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 停下 停下 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop! Stop, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.15,0:50:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把我们都害死的 求你停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get us killed! Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.49,0:50:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你在想什么 这都帮不了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you think you're doing, it's not helping us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.66,0:50:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 可以的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.99,0:50:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,停两秒钟 好吗 我们只要 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop for two seconds, okay? We just… No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.37,0:50:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会害死我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.00,0:50:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他饶恕我的原因 我知道你很害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why he spared me. I know you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.67,0:50:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 站住 - 我知道 我知道你很害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! - I know… I know you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.55,0:50:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.55,0:50:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不怕 听她的 - 你会害死我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not scared! Listen to her! - You're gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.34,0:51:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要这么做 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to do this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey! Zoey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.94,0:51:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他起来 快点 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him up! Come on! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.11,0:51:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撞到头时什么也没发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing happened when he hit his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.73,0:51:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这只是柜台尽头的陷阱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's just the end of the counters that are booby-trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.74,0:51:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去把他从瓷砖上弄走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get him off the tiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.70,0:51:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 帮我把他拉上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Help me pull him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.49,0:51:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.79,0:51:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.59,0:51:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还好吗 - 他失去知觉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he okay? - He's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.55,0:51:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得背着他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to carry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.76,0:51:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子神父毁了所有线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Nutbag torched all the clues!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.84,0:51:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案不在文件里 这实在太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The papers weren't the answer. There was too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.51,0:51:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,线索是什么来着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the clue again?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.38,0:51:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有钱能使鬼推磨 永远不要停止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Money makes the world turn. Never let it stop…"
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.97,0:51:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们得转点什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. We gotta turn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.19,0:51:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡住了 - 试试两边都转一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's stuck! - Try turning it both ways!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.60,0:51:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不是要找什么数字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were never looking for a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.52,0:51:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,“不要停止”指的是不要停止转动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't let it stop." Don't let it stop turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.90,0:51:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 拿到了 我拿到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - Got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.82,0:51:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.86,0:52:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个图 透明胶片 要把它放在什么上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a graph, a transparency. You gotta put it on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.62,0:52:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是那个地图 扔过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it goes on the map. Throw it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.66,0:52:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟后启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full laser-grid activation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.45,0:52:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全激光网格 - 我们时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in one minute. - We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.08,0:52:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toss it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.54,0:52:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从激光地板上扔过去 - 必须扔过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll throw it over the laser tiles. - You have to throw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.12,0:52:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扔过来 - 快 快 扔 - 你可以的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Throw it over! - Hurry! Come on! Go! - You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.42,0:52:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.01,0:52:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你们走 我来指路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. OK. You guys go and I'll guide you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.43,0:52:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不行 我绝不会扔下你自己走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No! I'm not leaving without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.51,0:52:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要人帮忙把这位天选之人扛走 - 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need help to carry the chosen one over here! - Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.89,0:52:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 我们要离开这 - 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry up! We gotta get out of here. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.02,0:52:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我拿到棒棒糖了 - 拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got the lollipops. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.48,0:52:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来 我够到他了 小心 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him, I got him. Careful, careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.49,0:52:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们确定要带着这混蛋吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sure we need this asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.20,0:52:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 向左移动两格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Take two tiles to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.49,0:52:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.03,0:52:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给你留下路标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving you a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.28,0:52:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 右移六格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Six tiles straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.25,0:52:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斜前方右移两格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two tiles diagonally to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.71,0:52:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.42,0:52:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斜前方左移两格 - 全激光网格将启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two tiles diagonally to the left. - Full laser-grid activation…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.46,0:53:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一 二 - 倒计时 十 九{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One, two. - …in ten, nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.76,0:53:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 八 七 六 五 - 然后一直走到头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- eight, seven, six, five… - And then straight all the way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.39,0:53:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,四 三 二 一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.99,0:53:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.13,0:53:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒醒 醒醒 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. Wake up. Wake up! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.09,0:53:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.63,0:53:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差点失去佐伊 这就是刚刚发生的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We almost lost Zoey out there, that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.09,0:53:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就喜欢犯傻和自私吗 - 好吧 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You like being stupid and selfish? - Okay, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.30,0:53:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很抱歉 - 你就是这样的人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Is that what you like, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.93,0:53:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 本 本 停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, Ben, Ben! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.85,0:53:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了 他只是想帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, enough! He was just trying to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.94,0:53:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.52,0:54:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们逃出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For getting us out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.07,0:54:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 别客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.70,0:54:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.95,0:54:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里要塌了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.12,0:54:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快跑 跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.79,0:54:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.79,0:54:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.92,0:54:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 快 快 - 赶快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, go, go! - Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.93,0:54:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这景色不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.61,0:54:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百六十度全景{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A full 360.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.44,0:54:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们之前的那组也有类似场景 - 我们也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They did something like this in our game. - Ours too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.03,0:54:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个是升级版{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some next-level shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.95,0:54:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,堵一百块钱 他们在这想淹死咱们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundred bucks says they try to drown us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.00,0:54:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 你开玩笑吧 这里这么多沙子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, are you kidding? Look at all this sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.33,0:54:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是地雷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely land mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.38,0:55:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里 拍立得相机 上面有字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out. It's a Polaroid camera and it says something.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.63,0:55:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 写了什么 - “更持久”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does that say? - "It will last longer."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.72,0:55:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像那句广告词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.76,0:55:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得要拍张照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you have to take a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.98,0:55:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况 刚才这有什么寓意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… What the hell was the point of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.03,0:55:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着像明信片 对吗 - 是 像回忆片段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It looks like a postcard, right? - Yeah, like a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.70,0:55:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片后有字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's writing on the back of the photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.33,0:55:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,写的是“把锚抛在沙漏湾”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says, "Drop your anchor at Hourglass Bay."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.41,0:55:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们后面的广告板上有这个名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the name on the billboard behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.25,0:55:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍的就是这个房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.54,0:55:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 也不是 看地平线那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, no, look at the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.79,0:55:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片里的船并没在墙那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a tiny boat that's not on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.76,0:55:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要找航行相关的物件 也许是个锚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're looking for something nautical. Maybe an anchor?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.22,0:55:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概率被地雷包围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly surrounded by land mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.97,0:55:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能不要再说地雷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you stop saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.85,0:55:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,请大家走动时务必小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just be careful what we're stepping on?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.27,0:55:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去码头看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna check by the pier.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.18,0:56:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,出口肯定在棚屋里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The exit has to be in this shack.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.89,0:56:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,用X标记位置吗 说不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}X marks the spot? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.06,0:56:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌这个冰箱就是出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet that fridge is our way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.32,0:56:10.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（把锚抛在沙漏湾）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.82,0:56:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还认为房间都有关联吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still think the rooms are connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.53,0:56:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才火车上的沙滩包 银行里索尼娅的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beach bag on the train, Sonya's name in the bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.79,0:56:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括刚才墙面的变化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even the walls changing like they just did,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.95,0:56:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉都相互关联 好像在讲一个故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it feels like it's all connected, like it's telling a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.08,0:56:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我说不好 感觉这故事说的不是我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…I don't know. It just doesn't feel like it's about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.42,0:56:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 船要沉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}SOS! Our ship is sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.05,0:56:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 我找到一个求救呼叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}SOS. I've got a weird distress call here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.05,0:56:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我这找到一个瓶中船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah and I got a ship in a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.89,0:56:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓶中船 我来看看这个冷柜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship in a bottle. I'm gonna check this cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.43,0:56:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看是什么在这扇门后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what's behind door number…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.35,0:56:44.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（咸蟹爪）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.73,0:56:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 现在知道锚用在哪里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey. Now we know what that anchor's for.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.11,0:56:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯塔顶上有一个天文望远镜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a telescope at the top of the lighthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.57,0:56:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该是找到那艘船了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I found our boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.99,0:56:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,“盲目之爱”像邦乔维那首歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Blind Love"? Like the Bon Jovi song?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.08,0:57:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 本弄明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, Ben figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.41,0:57:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺斯是邦乔维{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minos is Bon Jovi.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.46,0:57:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.92,0:57:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找锚吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find an anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.75,0:57:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,多加小心 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.05,0:57:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 之前我们怎么没看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, how did we miss this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.59,0:57:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下面这什么都没有 - 只有渔网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't see anything down here. - It's just netting.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.22,0:57:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.89,0:57:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.81,0:57:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该是和什么连一起的 - 稍等 看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This has to connect to something. - Wait, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.19,0:57:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个金属探测器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a metal detector.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.70,0:57:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能用吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.49,0:57:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.66,0:57:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么还要对着我的脸 - 我来试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why is it still in my face? - Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.45,0:57:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 给 - 让我看看 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. Here. - Let me see it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.54,0:57:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我爸用这东西找到过一个银币{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad found a silver dollar with one of those once.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.08,0:57:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,价值一美元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was worth a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.21,0:57:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.55,0:57:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人和奇怪的模型人是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is with these people and these crazy-ass mannequins?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.01,0:58:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定在沙子下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be under the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.90,0:58:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到了吗 - 听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you hear that? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.49,0:58:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.95,0:58:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还觉得是地雷吗 - 慢点 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You still thinking land mines? - Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.83,0:58:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是这里 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.42,0:58:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佐伊 能帮忙拿几个铲子吗 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zoey, can you bring some shovels? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.21,0:58:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.22,0:58:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我铲到东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.89,0:58:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,先放下铲子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose the shovels.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.47,0:58:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.06,0:58:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是锚 - 是锚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The anchor! - It's the anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.52,0:58:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿好了吗 - 咱们去门那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it? - Let's get it to the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.40,0:58:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 这可不妙 - 栓住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. That's not good. - It's tied down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.57,0:58:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡住了 拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stuck. Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.82,0:58:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家一起 - 帮我抓住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All together. - Help me grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.03,0:59:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.70,0:59:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉 继续拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull! Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.33,0:59:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳子连着什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's connected to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.29,0:59:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么回事 好像有什么状况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? Something's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.25,0:59:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗 沙子下面有东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear that? There's something under the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.92,0:59:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几位 - 那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys? - What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.05,0:59:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.38,0:59:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 情况不妙 - 那个锚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This can't be good. - The anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.35,0:59:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.26,0:59:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉我出去 - 拉住他 拉住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! Get me out! - Grab him! Grab him!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.06,0:59:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在往下沉 有什么往下拉我 快出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sinking! It's pulling me down! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.53,0:59:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的胳膊 抓住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab my arm! Grab!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.07,0:59:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它拖住了我的腿 - 我们没办法靠得更近了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's got my legs! - We can't get any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.49,0:59:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伸手 快 - 救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reach! Hurry! - Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.12,0:59:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab his hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.70,0:59:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.79,0:59:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 停下 瑞秋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, stop it! Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.08,0:59:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要什么 我们需要工具来救她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need something! We need something to get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.29,0:59:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 我去拿救生圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop moving! - I'm gonna get the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.00,0:59:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.38,0:59:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞秋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.67,1:00:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 瑞秋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.56,1:00:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.56,1:00:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把绳子给我 - 你不能下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me the rope. - You're not going down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.06,1:00:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做什么 她已经不在了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.10,1:00:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我说 - 拿着 好吗 拿好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen! - Hold this, okay? Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.03,1:00:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能去 - 听我说 我必须这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not going! - Listen! Listen to me. I have to do this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.01,1:00:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特 你疯了 停 停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate, you're crazy. Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.16,1:00:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉住他 坚持住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold him! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.39,1:00:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,都抓紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold it tight!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.30,1:00:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞秋 瑞秋 你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel! Rachel, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.07,1:00:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那出来 你能做到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out of there. You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.31,1:00:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞秋 瑞秋 抓住绳子 - 加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rachel! Rachel! Grab the rope! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.28,1:00:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你一定能行 - 起来 抓住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can do it! - Get up. Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.01,1:00:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 抓住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.13,1:00:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.01,1:00:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 内特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Nate!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.35,1:00:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.70,1:00:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特 快 顺着绳子向上 加油 内特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate! Come on! Go up the rope! Come on! Nate!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.62,1:00:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 顺着绳子过来 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go up the rope! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.75,1:00:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.19,1:00:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得帮他 我们得帮他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to help him! We have to!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.76,1:01:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绳子没了 - 他救了我 我们得救他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The rope's gone! - He saved me. We have to save him!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.30,1:01:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把锚拿过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the anchor!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.03,1:01:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞秋 - 我们帮不了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rachel! - We can't help him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.10,1:01:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 他们会把这里也沉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up! They're gonna sink this too.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.38,1:01:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 蔓延过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, it's going under us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.74,1:01:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 快点 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.00,1:01:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞秋 快点 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel, come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.37,1:01:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞秋 快点 他不在了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel, come on. He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.13,1:01:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么也做不了 我们要逃离这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing we can do! We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.20,1:01:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,“旅途愉快”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bon voyage."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.40,1:01:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我觉得这就是出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I think this is our exit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.76,1:01:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个冰箱没插电 我找到了电线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fridge is unplugged. I found the power cord.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.35,1:01:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有接头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not in touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.99,1:01:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许如果我们找到另一头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if we find the other end,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.13,1:01:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要把它插上 打开 就能出去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just plug it in, open it, and get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.01,1:01:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.04,1:01:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 电灯开关像是明信片上的灯塔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. The light switch, it looks like the lighthouse in the postcard.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.41,1:01:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be a connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.21,1:01:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.76,1:01:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们触碰东西时没发生坏事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause nothing bad happens when we touch things.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.83,1:01:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧 我们要继续了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it! We have to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.32,1:01:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
