Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.76,1:09:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生来就有一个基因的微缺失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born with a microdeletion in one of my genes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.26,1:09:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会影响感官 我无法感受到生理疼痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It affects sensation. I can't feel physical pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.12,1:09:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just imagine…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.29,1:09:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,米诺斯会想出什么谜题对付感觉不到痛的怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the kinds of puzzles Minos came up with for the pain freaks.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.10,1:09:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在反击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fighting back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.20,1:09:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做正确的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.89,1:09:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.29,1:09:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小瑞 你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rach, do…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.02,1:09:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.33,1:09:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there's something over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.43,1:09:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.98,1:10:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.42,1:10:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出来了 快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.41,1:10:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.85,1:10:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 我们出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. We're out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.80,1:10:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别关上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Don't let it close!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.30,1:10:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.95,1:10:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.81,1:10:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在游戏里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still in the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.56,1:10:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.02,1:10:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他们对你做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. What did they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.40,1:10:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是酸 当计时器走完之后 会下酸雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's acid. When the timer runs out, it rains acid.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.86,1:10:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,酸 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acid? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.24,1:10:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得快点 我们要找到杂货店的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to hurry. We have to find the keys to the bodega.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.28,1:10:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们解开这个锁 我觉得这是出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could just get through this lock, I think it's the way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.11,1:11:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,五月二十六日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May 26th.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.23,1:11:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是〇五二六 但我们需要一个钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 0-5-2-6 again, but we need a key.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.30,1:11:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 但是她拿着个钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but she's holding a key.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.58,1:11:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 但这有什么帮助 - 我们只有一分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but how does that help us? - We have a minute left.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.60,1:11:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一直看着你 而且她是个天使 对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'll always be watching over you" And she's an angel, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.23,1:11:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 她头上有一朵云{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! There's a cloud above her,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.33,1:11:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们爬上去 对吗 我们爬到那上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we climb it, right? We climb it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.05,1:11:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 防火通道上有个梯子 - 好 我爬上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's a ladder on the fire escape! - Okay. I'll climb it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.12,1:11:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莉 你看到什么了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bri, do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.50,1:11:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这有这么多植物 好多植物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are there so many plants? So many plants.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.35,1:11:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.37,1:11:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我找到了一个钥匙 扣在栏杆上了 - 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I found a key! It's stuck to the railing. - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.91,1:11:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有三十秒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only have 30 seconds left!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.56,1:11:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 布莉安娜 你能做到的 - 我拿到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Brianna. You can do it! - I got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.67,1:11:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿 抓住 - 拿到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, catch! - Got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.67,1:11:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 试试 快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, try it. Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.98,1:11:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快下来 又快下雨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! Get down here! It's about to rain again!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.48,1:11:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.65,1:11:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.85,1:11:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.98,1:11:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 把门抬起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up! Lift the gate!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.12,1:12:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是个锁住的门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's another locked door.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.31,1:12:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,雨停了 他们重启了计时器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rain stopped. They reset the timer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.47,1:12:33.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重大新闻）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.96,1:12:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,环保活动人士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conservation activists have.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.77,1:12:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在城市里引起了一系列链式反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}started a chain reaction throughout the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.21,1:12:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着水费的上涨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With rising water costs,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.76,1:12:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市居民开始转向收集城市雨水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}residents are turning to urban rainwater collection.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.68,1:12:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,雨水收集{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water collection.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.18,1:12:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们希望我们收集雨水 - 环保活动人士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They want us to collect the rain. - Conservation activists…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.61,1:12:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个遮阳篷落了下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another awning came down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.53,1:12:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在城市里引起了一系列链式反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have started a chain reaction throughout the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.11,1:12:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 链式反应 电话亭上有链子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, chain reaction. There's a chain on the phone booth.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.10,1:13:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.99,1:13:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 他们希望我们接电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. They want us to answer the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.71,1:13:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们收集了雨水 就能用酸把链条烧断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we collect the rain, we can use the acid to burn through.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.56,1:13:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这能行 - 我们怎么收集酸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That could work. - How do we contain acid?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.50,1:13:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 别碰那个 - 不 没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, don't touch that! - No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.20,1:13:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会烧伤你的手 - 我没事 我感觉不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll burn your hands. - I'm fine. I don't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.78,1:13:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,盐酸能烧穿所有东西 除了某种塑料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydrochloric acid burns through everything but a certain plastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.70,1:13:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,找找任何没有融化的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look for anything that hasn't melted.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.54,1:13:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.74,1:13:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有东西都融化了 连遮阳篷都融化了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's melted, even the awnings.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.53,1:13:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有二十秒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only have 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.25,1:13:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.50,1:13:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有个番茄酱瓶子 这个瓶子没融化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a ketchup bottle here. There's a bottle hasn't melted.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.04,1:13:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.86,1:13:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,PMP 聚甲基戊烯 就是这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}PMP. Polymethylpentene. Yes, this is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.13,1:13:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,酸不会融化这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acid won't melt this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.74,1:13:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没多少时间了 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.72,1:13:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 躲在遮阳篷下面 - 好 马上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry! Get under the awning! - All right, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.23,1:14:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有效 这有效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked! It worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.04,1:14:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.61,1:14:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有用 这有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working! It's working.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.59,1:14:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快 接电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go! Answer it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.84,1:14:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.30,1:14:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 让我试试 喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me try it. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.68,1:14:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nobody there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.03,1:14:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 当天气转好了 给我们一个电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay."When the weather turns, give us a call."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.13,1:14:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定和那辆出租车有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have something to do with the cab.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.97,1:14:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.82,1:14:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么 - 待在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Stay in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.75,1:14:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没有足够的地方容纳我们所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not enough room for all of us!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.38,1:14:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 试试看 - 我们漏了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, let's try. - We're missing something!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.49,1:14:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也不知道 - 你不能待在外面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know! - You can't stay out there!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.21,1:15:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们没得选择 - 不 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not like we really have a choice! - No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.03,1:15:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能这样 我们可以挤进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't do it like this. We can fit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.23,1:15:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 抓住 用这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey, catch! Use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.87,1:15:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey! Zoey!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.98,1:15:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.75,1:15:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当铺 当铺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Pawnshop." Pawnshop!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.90,1:15:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个戒指 把电话拿起来然后把它放回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Three rings." Pick up the phone and put it back down!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.98,1:15:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.79,1:15:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把电话拿起来然后把它放回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up the phone and put it back down!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.34,1:15:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在在第三声铃响接起电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now pick it up on the third ring!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.74,1:15:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三声 好的 一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third ring? Okay. One.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.52,1:15:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.36,1:15:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到出租车了吗 那个门 门 门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see the cab? The door, the door, the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.78,1:15:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 准备好了吗 走 - 一起走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Ready? Go! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.03,1:15:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 - 赶快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.41,1:15:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会打开了 他们锁住了 - 打开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It won't open. They locked it. - Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.38,1:16:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回到电话亭 - 佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get back to the booth! - Zoey!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.79,1:16:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 试试看前门 - 电话亭 他们切断了后路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Try the front door. - The booth! They're cutting us off!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.91,1:16:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 上锁了 我打不开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey, it's locked! I can't get it open!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.10,1:16:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它是打不开的 - 他们锁住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It won't open. - They're locked!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.36,1:16:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它是打不开的 - 试试看前门 试着开前门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It won't open. - Try the front! Try the front.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.15,1:16:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … I can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.24,1:16:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 没有地方可以去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no! - There's nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.32,1:16:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莉安娜 听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brianna, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.10,1:16:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们得逞 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give them the satisfaction, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.65,1:16:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别放弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.13,1:16:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.09,1:16:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.20,1:16:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.73,1:16:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快 赶快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.03,1:16:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的过渡滑道出了问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an error in the transition chute.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.44,1:16:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.78,1:16:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一个故障 等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a malfunction. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.24,1:17:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.23,1:17:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终房间 你一声令下随时可以激活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Final room. Ready to activate as soon as you call it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.07,1:17:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,调出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.16,1:17:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个设计什么时候批准的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was this design approved?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.99,1:17:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在你几天前送来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in the expedited.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.95,1:17:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,更改的加急单里 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}changes you delivered just a few days ago, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.39,1:17:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些改动都是通过这个送来的 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those changes were delivered on this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.56,1:17:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上上报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.98,1:17:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我们继续游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no. We play through.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.13,1:17:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经有漏洞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been breached.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.12,1:17:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的雇主说了不论发生什么都继续游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our employers have made it very clear we continue no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.13,1:17:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们游戏历史上赌注最高的一场比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the highest bet-upon match in our game's history.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.06,1:17:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 你没事的 我把你带到了安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. You're okay. I've brought you to a safe place.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.82,1:17:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头脑会在几分钟之后清醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head'll clear in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.23,1:17:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在追踪你父亲的手机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tracking your father's phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.85,1:17:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在来这边的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on his way here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.86,1:17:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去楼上试着为你争取些时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going upstairs to try and buy you some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.08,1:18:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.07,1:18:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.70,1:18:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.99,1:18:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很困惑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I know you're confused,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.37,1:18:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要仔细听我说 行吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you really gotta listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.35,1:18:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经没有多少时间了 - 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's not a lot of time. - Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.54,1:18:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直关注你很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been watching you for so long,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.21,1:18:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都忘了我们还不是朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot we're not already friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.77,1:18:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Claire.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.01,1:18:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要小心 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.17,1:18:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你随时可以走 但我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're free to go at any time. But I really need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.04,1:18:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以如果你能听听我说话 拜托 - 这些是线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So if you could just hear me out. Please. - Those are the clues.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.95,1:18:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,地铁 雨 银行 海滩 这是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The subway, the rain, the bank, the beach. It was…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.62,1:18:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.38,1:18:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关于你的故事 索尼娅 - 她是我的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The story's about you. Sonya… - She was my mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.87,1:18:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个壁画 那个日期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the mural. That date.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.85,1:18:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是她去世的那天 对吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the day she died, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.41,1:18:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会看透我的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd be the one to see me through it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.80,1:19:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.84,1:19:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你设计的房间 - 你不明白 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You designed the rooms? - You don't understand, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.27,1:19:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲 他把我锁在这 他逼我做这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father, he locked me in here. He forced me to do all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.07,1:19:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个杀人犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a murderer!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.38,1:19:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽我所能去反抗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I resisted for as long as I could,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.04,1:19:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我意识到我逃出去的唯一方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I realized that my only way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.38,1:19:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是得到你的帮助 如果你相信我的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was if I had your help, if I gained your trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.01,1:19:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.71,1:19:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你杀了本 - 因为我救了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You killed Ben! - Because I saved him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.98,1:19:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 佐伊 本还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive, Zoey. Ben's alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.47,1:19:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.26,1:19:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在沙子里建了一个隐藏的逃生箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built a hidden extractor tank in the sand.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.51,1:19:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩斯勒找到了他 他在隧道里 他很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ensler got him. He's in the tunnels, he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.86,1:19:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能给你看 看 看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can show you. Look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.37,1:19:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.83,1:19:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了他 佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved him, Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.85,1:19:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本 - 等我逃出这里 我们能去找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ben? - After I get out of here, we can get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.27,1:19:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他救出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.20,1:19:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不不不不 - 等等 发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no. No. No. - Wait, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.76,1:19:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.13,1:19:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他去哪了 - 不 我爸的人找到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd he go? - No! My dad's men found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.56,1:20:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.94,1:20:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 她在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit. Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.64,1:20:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.90,1:20:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.04,1:20:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再玩你们的蠢游戏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna play your stupid game anymore!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.83,1:20:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得做些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.17,1:20:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里救不了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get him out from in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.76,1:20:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一有权限的电脑在我爸的书房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only computer that has access is in my father's study.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.30,1:20:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.95,1:20:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间了 我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time. I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.77,1:20:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮帮我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you please just help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.26,1:20:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 密码锁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this? A combination lock!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.06,1:20:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,四位数 真有新意 还有谜题 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four numbers. Really original. And a puzzle, too, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.77,1:20:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你这么聪明的人来帮我解开那谜题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need somebody as smart as you to help me solve that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.80,1:20:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他来说一切都是游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is a game to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.48,1:20:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说不管我怎样努力尝试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that no matter how hard I try,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.15,1:20:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人永远都解不开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would never figure it out on my own,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.08,1:20:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.38,1:20:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这个该放哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Where does it go?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.75,1:20:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边的图片关联着右边的密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The images on the left correspond to a code on the right,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.84,1:20:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有三次机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I only get three chances.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.96,1:20:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就会脱氧而死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until all the oxygen is sucked out of my cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.21,1:20:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我十八岁生日时已经用掉了一次 - 好 所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I already used one on my 18th birthday. - Okay, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.61,1:20:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.25,1:21:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 昆虫 有蜉蝣和白蚁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so insects. We have a mayfly and then a termite.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.87,1:21:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一种非洲堆土白蚁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an African mound-building termite.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.54,1:21:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们最长能活五十年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can live for up to 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.83,1:21:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而蜉蝣朝生夕死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayflies only live a day,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.66,1:21:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以可能和寿命有关 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe it's something to do with life cycles, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.14,1:21:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.00,1:21:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有铱 钛 锂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have iridium, titanium, lithium.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.75,1:21:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,原子序数为三 二十二 七十七{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The atomic numbers for that are 3, 22, 77.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.02,1:21:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是和原子量有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the atomic weights matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.71,1:21:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.19,1:21:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.18,1:21:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 希腊的历史性时刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, moments in Greek history.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.21,1:21:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,特洛伊战争 公元前一二五〇年 奥运会是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Battle of Troy, 1250 B.C. The Olympic Games, which is…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.43,1:21:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,公元前七七六年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}776 b.C.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.56,1:21:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后第三块是伯里克利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the third tile is Pericles.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.08,1:21:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,生卒年为公元前四九五到四二九年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lived from 495 to 429.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.68,1:21:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些谜题都没有联系 我们有地方没想到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the puzzles make sense. We're missing something!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.95,1:21:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.96,1:21:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 你在干什么 跟我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey, what are you doing? Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.69,1:21:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你怎样努力尝试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how hard you try,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.59,1:21:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人永远也无法解开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll never be able to solve it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.79,1:21:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人解不开 而你被困在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do it on your own. And you're stuck in a box.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.01,1:21:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要那样做 只是为了奚落你吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he do that? Just to taunt you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.23,1:21:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,洞察之道 如果你看不到 那就换个角度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors of perception. If you can't see, then change the view.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.37,1:21:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间了 我爸随时会到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time. My dad is gonna be here any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.55,1:21:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么 跟我说 我们能一起想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Talk to me. We can work this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.73,1:22:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,洞察之道 如果你看不到 那就换个角度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors of perception. If you can't see, change the view.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.94,1:22:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.82,1:22:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到了什么 - 是透镜全息图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you see? - It's a lenticular hologram.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.63,1:22:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我能看到你看不到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I can see what you can't see.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.44,1:22:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你爸才说你一个人永远也解不开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why your dad said you'll never be able to solve it on your own!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.12,1:22:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们是什么 - 是三张图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are they? - There are three images.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.30,1:22:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个是五角星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first one's a pentagram,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.75,1:22:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二个是鹦鹉螺的截面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the second is a cross section of a nautilus shell,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.15,1:22:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三个是DNA分子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the third one is a DNA molecule.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.77,1:22:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是斐波那契数列{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's Fibonacci's sequence?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.58,1:22:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这三张图里都有黄金比例{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the golden ratio exists with all three of those images.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.60,1:22:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 所以是什么 一点六吗 - 一点六一八{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, so, what? So 1.6? - 1.618!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.85,1:22:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.62,1:22:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金比例是用希腊字母Ф表示的 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The golden ratio is represented by the Greek letter phi, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.71,1:22:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.59,1:22:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这两者之间有何联系 - 是小写{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But how does that correspond to this? - Lowercase!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.40,1:22:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有字母都是小写的 所以Φ的小写是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of the tiles are in lowercase, so the symbol for phi is…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.31,1:22:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道了 我知道了 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've got it. I got it! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.05,1:23:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.47,1:23:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.85,1:23:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going back in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.16,1:23:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样做 克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.47,1:23:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你做了什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any idea what you have just done?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.11,1:23:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎能这样对我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.00,1:23:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我为你做了那么多之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything I have done for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.06,1:23:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就把我放出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me out of here right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.87,1:23:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克莱尔 - 本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Claire. - Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.74,1:23:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.81,1:23:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.19,1:24:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊 快 这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey, hurry! This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.99,1:24:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,零 五 二 六{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero, five, two, six.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.45,1:24:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.08,1:24:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把他救出来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get him out?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.06,1:24:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在救了 - 救他出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm trying. - Get him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.38,1:24:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,根代码太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just too much root code.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.44,1:24:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得覆写整个系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to override the entire thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.35,1:24:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撑不了多久了 你得快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna make it much longer. You have to hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.10,1:24:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我做到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.09,1:24:36.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统覆写完成）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.82,1:24:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.76,1:24:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你逃出后 客人们强烈要求返场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you escaped, the clients begged for an encore.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.80,1:24:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,冠军之战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A game of champions.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.95,1:24:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始让人赢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They started letting people win.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.82,1:24:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是唯一真正击败他们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one who ever really beat them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.15,1:25:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本在哪 - 你已经知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Ben? - You already know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.01,1:25:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐标 你一直都是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coordinates. You were right all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.28,1:25:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那地方在哪 给{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where the building is. Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.80,1:25:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,开我爸的车 反正他也阻止不了你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my dad's car. It's not like he can stop you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.37,1:25:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么处置他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.29,1:25:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我跑得够远后 我就会报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I get far enough away, I'm gonna call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.00,1:25:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会为他的所作所为付出代价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll pay for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.54,1:25:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道他们仍在逍遥法外对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know they're still out there though, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.27,1:25:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能围捕你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can hunt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.15,1:25:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里是为了证据 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came here for proof, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.52,1:25:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我也许锁了几扇门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I might have locked some doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.82,1:25:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 你检查网络了没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir! - Have you checked the network?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.19,1:25:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们这次清理痕迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made it a little more difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.48,1:25:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍难了一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for them to clean up their mess this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.40,1:25:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.43,1:26:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.21,1:26:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 你不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, miss. You can't…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.51,1:26:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 女士 停下 - 本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss, stop! - Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.46,1:26:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben? Ben!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.57,1:26:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本 - 佐伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ben. - Zoey?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.23,1:26:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是和我一起的 给我们点时间 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. She's with me. Just give us a minute, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.36,1:26:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.04,1:26:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从沙子里掉下去后 有个人在那等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I went through the sand, there was a guy waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.47,1:26:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给了我这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.48,1:26:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这是威胁还是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if it's a threat or…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.04,1:26:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是“感谢”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's a "Thank you."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.62,1:27:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.25,1:27:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安全了 本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're safe now, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.54,1:27:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.83,1:27:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想保护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only ever wanted to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.36,1:27:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷走了我的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole everything from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.16,1:27:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年我也能对你说同样的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a time when I could've said the same thing to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.60,1:27:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在那天前我就早已失去了母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that I lost mother long before that day.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.61,1:27:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她的生命在倒计时 她心里有计划了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew she was reaching her end, that she was making plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.03,1:27:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我决定测试她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I decided to test her.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.85,1:28:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 你弄疼我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire. You're hurting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.16,1:28:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管如此我还是希望那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, I hoped that it wasn't true.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.48,1:28:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我母亲能爱真正的我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hoped that my own mother could love me for who I really was.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.59,1:28:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们放回去 放回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put them back. Put them back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.97,1:28:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全都要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.61,1:28:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.37,1:28:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟随了我好奇心的引导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed my curiosity wherever it led,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.29,1:28:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你们两个都要聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was smarter than both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.95,1:28:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母应该爱他们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parents are supposed to love their children.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.46,1:28:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不该把他们像垃圾一样丢掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not supposed to throw them away like trash!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.80,1:28:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何在哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.55,1:28:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要帮助 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need help, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.67,1:28:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.61,1:28:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能以你需要的方式帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the way you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.49,1:28:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要离开一段时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to go away for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.42,1:28:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至用除掉她 向你展示了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even tried to show you how useful I could be to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.68,1:28:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能有多有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by getting rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.03,1:28:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你是怎么报答我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how did you repay me?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.69,1:28:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷去了我所有的主意 占为己有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole all of my ideas. You took all of the credit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.39,1:28:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.79,1:28:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你创造了那么美的房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I created such beautiful rooms for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.15,1:28:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不管盈利有多高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no matter how high the profits soared,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.40,1:28:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍旧隔离 压制我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you still censored and stifled me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.16,1:29:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我们能一起 我们能成为一个团队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, we could be together. We could be a team.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.11,1:29:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和妈会很为我骄傲的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Mom are gonna be so proud of me…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.17,1:29:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们看到我能做到什么时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you see what I can really do.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.62,1:29:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 错误 - 再见了 爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Incorrect. - Goodbye, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.62,1:29:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始清除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiating purge.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.44,1:29:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire!
